{
    "title": "Bubble BD Comics Mangas",
    "description": "Bubble is EVERYTHING for fans of Comics, Comics and Mangas. Organizing, discovering and ordering effortlessly is simply Bubble.\r\n\r\n**Bubble does not support reading digital comics, webtoons or mangatoons**\r\n\r\n**Bubble a free** comic book manga library management service. It allows you to list your Comic Strips, Comics or Mangas, to consult your incomplete series in 1s like Star Wars, Dragon Ball, Largo Winch, Asterix, or Fairy Tail, to be notified of your next releases and to order them in 2 clicks. Thanks to its media 9emeart (https://www.bubblebd.com/9emeart) and ComicsBlog (http://www.comicsblog.fr), Bubble will also help you to follow the news BD Comics Mangas and to discover your next moves of heart.\r\n\r\n- Add hundreds of albums ultra quickly with multiple addition (by series) and barcode scanning\r\n- Share your collection or wishlist with loved ones\r\n- Receive personalized outing notifications\r\n- Order your albums online (they are packaged with great care)\r\n- Reserve your albums at your bookstore and pick them up in store (at no additional cost)\r\n- Ultra-responsive customer service, our team will answer you by chat or email\r\n\r\n**Bubble Infinity**: it's all Bubble + advanced features like advanced management (read/unread, advanced stats), loan management and many other things, all without advertising.\r\n\r\nUpon registration, 30 days are offered to test Bubble Infinity, then to unlock advanced features, buy directly in the application 3 months, 1 year or 2 years of Infinity (payment in 1 time and without automatic renewal).\r\n\r\nOUR USERS LOVE IT\r\n***** A little wonder *****\r\n\"No complaints, perfect management application, and I feel that new features will come to flesh it all out!\" by MisTeRmO1\r\n***** Top and essential *****\r\n\"No more wondering what volume I am in front of a shelf and looking for unexpectedly! And there are not only comics there are also Mangas! Indispensable\" by Sisters\r\n***** A successful and effective app *****\r\n\"Simple and intuitive to use for an up-to-date list and alerts on outings, with quick and friendly help when needed via chat, also very quick additions... In short, a very successful and effective app\" by Clash 2324\r\n\r\nCONTACT\r\nAdvice or questions? We love hearing from you: contact@bubblebd.com",
    "descriptionHTML": "Bubble is EVERYTHING for fans of Comics, Comics and Mangas. Organizing, discovering and ordering effortlessly is simply Bubble.<br><br>**Bubble does not support reading digital comics, webtoons or mangatoons**<br><br>**Bubble a free** comic book manga library management service. It allows you to list your Comic Strips, Comics or Mangas, to consult your incomplete series in 1s like Star Wars, Dragon Ball, Largo Winch, Asterix, or Fairy Tail, to be notified of your next releases and to order them in 2 clicks. Thanks to its media 9emeart (https://www.bubblebd.com/9emeart) and ComicsBlog (http://www.comicsblog.fr), Bubble will also help you to follow the news BD Comics Mangas and to discover your next moves of heart.<br><br>- Add hundreds of albums ultra quickly with multiple addition (by series) and barcode scanning<br>- Share your collection or wishlist with loved ones<br>- Receive personalized outing notifications<br>- Order your albums online (they are packaged with great care)<br>- Reserve your albums at your bookstore and pick them up in store (at no additional cost)<br>- Ultra-responsive customer service, our team will answer you by chat or email<br><br>**Bubble Infinity**: it&#39;s all Bubble + advanced features like advanced management (read/unread, advanced stats), loan management and many other things, all without advertising.<br><br>Upon registration, 30 days are offered to test Bubble Infinity, then to unlock advanced features, buy directly in the application 3 months, 1 year or 2 years of Infinity (payment in 1 time and without automatic renewal).<br><br>OUR USERS LOVE IT<br>***** A little wonder *****<br>&quot;No complaints, perfect management application, and I feel that new features will come to flesh it all out!&quot; by MisTeRmO1<br>***** Top and essential *****<br>&quot;No more wondering what volume I am in front of a shelf and looking for unexpectedly! And there are not only comics there are also Mangas! Indispensable&quot; by Sisters<br>***** A successful and effective app *****<br>&quot;Simple and intuitive to use for an up-to-date list and alerts on outings, with quick and friendly help when needed via chat, also very quick additions... In short, a very successful and effective app&quot; by Clash 2324<br><br>CONTACT<br>Advice or questions? We love hearing from you: contact@bubblebd.com",
